 "texto": "Fast, effective cleaning that actually makes life easier. The H2O X5 is a powerful 5-in-1 steam cleaner designed to handle your entire home with just one device. From floors and carpets to windows, tiles and more, it uses the power of steam to remove dirt and grime, no harsh chemicals needed. Lightweight and easy to maneuver, the H2O X5 saves time while delivering a deeper clean, so you can spend less time cleaning and more time living.",
